seq v=1 rig=screen program=claude build=2.1.0
# T1: an approve admitted with no box open, the first box opening 600 ms
# later (past STEP_INPUT_LEAD_MS): it binds nothing, accepted before or
# after.
see busy
admit harness act=approve
accept
at 600 see prompt edit
expect open p1 approval par=t1 box=edit at=600
see busy
expect close p1 approval out=passed by=- at=600
at 1000 admit harness act=approve
at 1600 see prompt edit
expect open p2 approval par=t1 box=edit at=1600
accept
see busy
expect close p2 approval out=passed by=-
